{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":true}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Blink Drake","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/blink-drake.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/blink-drake.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Blink Drake","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":190,"temp":0,"max":190,"details":""},"ac":{"value":29,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":50}],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"paralyzed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"mental","value":10,"exceptions":[]}],"resistances":[{"type":"all-damage","value":8,"exceptions":["force"],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["draconic"],"details":""},"level":{"value":11},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Blink drakes are dragons infused with teleportation magic. Their personalities and behaviors vary wildly. While some blink drakes are capricious and playful, playing pranks and stealing as suits their whims, others are vicious and aggressive, using their teleportation abilities to methodically assassinate their foes. Blink drakes are small, even compared to their weaker drake cousins—barely the size of a human—but their magical powers make them a dangerous and elusive foe. Those who would face a blink drake are advised to either bring force effects or else some kind of magic to prevent the creature's constant teleportation.</p>\n<h2>Mutable Minds</h2>\n<p>Blink drakes' bodies are in constant flux from their incessant blinking, but that leaves their minds as their greatest weakness. Some scholars believe that blink drakes are more affected by mental attacks because they had to evolve mutable minds to keep up with everyday life while blinking. Others wonder whether someone or something might have been responsible for originally infusing blink drakes with magic and if that mysterious entity built in a weakness to exploit.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 175/390/720 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing), armor (light, medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Deception, Intimidation, Stealth)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, constitution, dexterity, elongating, energy resistant (positive), force, spells (Arcane: blink, blink charge, dimension door, unexpected transposition), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Joshua White","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":7},"con":{"mod":5},"int":{"mod":-3},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":2}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":20,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":20,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":26,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":23},"athletics":{"base":21},"deception":{"base":19},"intimidation":{"base":21},"stealth":{"base":25}},"traits":{"value":["dragon"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"med"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/blink-drake.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Darkvision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687193849855,"modifiedTime":1687193849855,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"qcv28EjxLOTExrTu"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Practiced Transposition","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A blink drake gains greater effects from teleportation magic. It can teleport up to twice the usual range with its teleportation spells, and if an effect would cause the drake to teleport to a space not of the drake's choosing (including from its own <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.zR67Rt3UMHKC5evy]{Blink}</em> spell), the drake can instead choose any valid space within range to appear, or choose not to teleport. In order to subvert a foe's teleportation effect in this way, the drake must succeed at a counteract check with a counteract level of 6 and a counteract modifier of [[/r 1d20+20 #Counteract]]{+20}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"VN5xX7CjeH4xa4F1","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687193996445,"modifiedTime":1687194029317,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Attack of Opportunity (Tail Only)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.AttackOfOpportunity]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"attack-of-opportunity","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194121893,"modifiedTime":1687194129283,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.hFtNbo1LKYCoDy2O","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Ol6yDec49XF31PLH"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Reactive Blink","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The blink drake is targeted by an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The drake shimmers and blinks away. It increases its resistance to all damage except force from <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.zR67Rt3UMHKC5evy]{Blink}</em> against the triggering attack from 8 to 24. After the attack is resolved, the drake then teleports to an open space within 10 feet.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"reactive-blink","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"Resistance","type":"all-damage","value":24,"predicate":["reactive-blink"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","teleportation"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"lNBUYqED46tZWj1c","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194142144,"modifiedTime":1687194246734,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Warpblood","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The drake takes slashing, piercing, or persistent bleed damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Uncontrolled teleportation magic attempts to transpose things in unpredictable ways as it escapes the drake. Every creature adjacent to the drake must attempt a @Check[type:reflex|dc:27|basic:true] save against @Damage[2d6[force]] damage. A creature that critically fails this save is teleported 10 feet in a random direction (similarly to the effects of Sustaining a blink spell).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane","force","teleportation"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"free"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"round"}},"effects":[],"_id":"0JiQz3bX6C9Yn0oE","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194142526,"modifiedTime":1691261014408,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fangs","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"H4nJZPJshr4zjWr6":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"piercing","category":null},"LvXMLydh9bunM8aW":{"damage":"1d8","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":24},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"ZepKgACFjA6TwkZB","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194333459,"modifiedTime":1687194362183,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Tail","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse","reach-10"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"H4YIRJ6yzB7irFmP":{"damage":"2d8+10","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":24},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"NUWvjxdG26RTe7Zy","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194333935,"modifiedTime":1687194395285,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"name":"Arcane Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":19,"dc":27},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"cjX0j6VI2nxqYxHa","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194402869,"modifiedTime":1687194458936,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/unexpected-transposition.webp","name":"Unexpected Transposition","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You are targeted with an enemy's Strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When attacked, you attempt to quickly swap your own position with that of another creature. A creature that is unwilling to swap places with you must attempt a Will save. Willing creatures automatically fail. If you successfully switch places with the target, the triggering attack is resolved against that creature as if it had been the original target of the attack. After the swap, you and the target are both temporarily immune to unexpected transposition spells for 1 minute. You automatically switch places if the target is willing. If it's unwilling, it can attempt a Will save. Neither of you teleports if the target succeeds at its save.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"unexpected-transposition","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Secrets of Magic","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":6},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature other than the triggering enemy"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"reaction"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"will","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"cjX0j6VI2nxqYxHa","heightenedLevel":6},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194424271,"modifiedTime":1687194424271,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OOMQ8Z6EIrGt5NJ6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"OdvcvQ5Xg19TYrHV"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/blink-charge.webp","name":"Blink Charge","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You propel yourself through the fabric of space to deal a blow carrying the momentum of your teleportation. You teleport to an empty space adjacent to a creature you can see within range, then make a Strike against the creature with a weapon you're wielding. The Strike deals damage, plus an extra 2d8 force damage, depending on the result of your Strike.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Double damage, plus after the Strike, you can teleport the target into an empty space up to 5 feet away from its current position. The new space must be on the ground if it started on the ground, in the air if it was flying, and so on.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The Strike deals full damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The Strike deals no damage, but the target takes [[/r 1d8[force]]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The Strike deals no damage, and you take 1d8 force damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The spell's range increases by 60 feet, and any force damage the spell deals is increased by [[/r 1d8[force]]].</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"blink-charge","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","force","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Secrets of Magic","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"60 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":false,"formula":"2d8","type":"force","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"cjX0j6VI2nxqYxHa","heightenedLevel":5,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":2,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.0.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1687194432075,"modifiedTime":1687194443946,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.TDaMnCtZ72uyYrz8","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"1aBVoStFTM1W6M79"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dimension-door.webp","name":"Dimension Door","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Opening a door that bypasses normal space, you instantly transport yourself and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to a clear space within range you can see. If this would bring another creature with you-even if you're carrying it in an extradimensional container-the spell is lost.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 1 mile. You don't need to be able to see your destination, as long as you have been there in the past and know its relative location and distance from you. You are temporarily immune for 1 hour.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dimension-door","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"prev